    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32338" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλεκτ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>picked out, select,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ibyc.
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.100
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῶν ἐ. δικαστήριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					938b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. δικασταί,</span>=Lat.
				<i>iudices selecti</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				499.3
			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶς</span> interpol. in Suid.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίλεκτος.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>choice, pure,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμύρνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ex.</u>
					30.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοήθημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Asclep.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				9.12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PRein.</u>
					43.9
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλεκτόν,</span>=
				<i>corn,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aq.
				<u>Ps.</u>
				64(65).14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>chosen of God, elect,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Is.</u>
				43.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				13.20
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
